# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Web3Forms — contact form delivery (https://web3forms.com)
# This key is public by design (it ships in the client bundle); inbox spam
# protection is handled on Web3Forms' side. Create a free access key at
# https://web3forms.com and paste it here. When unset, the contact form falls
# back to opening the visitor's mail client (mailto:).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
